<div class="colmidl">
    <h1 class="titile">Pricing Formula and Premium for Copper Products</h2>
    
    
    <p><span class="subhead2" style="color: #B30000; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; background-color: #fff;">Basic Price = [(LME price + Premium) X Multiplication Factor X Exchange Rate ] + Handling Charges&nbsp;</span></p></br>
    
    
    <p><u><b>Where</u> :</b></p>
    <p><b style="color:#a34500;">a)&nbsp;<u>LME Price</u> :</b> Daily LME CSP / Average LME CSP (for the period in case of average bookings)</p>
    <p><b style="color:#a34500;">b)&nbsp;<u>Premium</u> :</b></p>
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        <div id="viewTable">
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
        <th  width="25%" style="text-align:center" rowspan="2">Product</th>
        <th width="75%"colspan="3" style="text-align:center">Premium</th>
        
        </tr>
        <tr >
        @*<th  width="25%" style="text-align:center"> -</th>*@
        <th  width="25%" style="text-align:center">CSP / M / RT</th>
        <th  width="25%" style="text-align:center">PC / FN / W </th>
        </tr>		
        <tr>
        <td class="subhead2" height="41">CC Rod 8mm (Std. &amp; N Std.)</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">160</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">180</td>
                
        </tr>
        <tr>
        <td class="subhead2" height="40">CC Rods 11 mm &amp; 12.5 mm</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">180</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">200</td>
              
        </tr>
        <tr>
        <td class="subhead2" height="40">CC Rods 16 mm</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">200</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">220</td>
                
        </tr>
        <tr>
        <td class="subhead2" height="40">CC Rods 19.6 mm</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">220</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">240</td>
                
        </tr>
        <tr>
        <td class="subhead2" height="40">Cathode (Full)</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">80</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">100</td>
               
        </tr>
        <tr>
        <td class="subhead2" height="40">Cathode Cut</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">110</td>
        <td class="tblcol2tr" style="text-align:center">130</td>
               
        </tr>
        
        
        </table>
        </div>
        
        
        </br>
        <p>&nbsp;Where : D=Daily CSP, M=Monthly avg. CSP, W=Weekly Avg. CSP, FN=Fortnightly avg. CSP, RT= Real Time, PC= Price Circular</p>
        <p>*<b>Note</b> :  Forward option is available only for CSP and not Average bookings </p>
        
        
        
        
        </br>
        <p><b style="color:#a34500;">c)&nbsp;<u>Multiplication Factor</u> :</b> 1.040 </p>
		
        
        
        
        
        </br>
        <p><b style="color:#a34500;">d)&nbsp;<u>Exchange rate Options</u> :</b> </p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;"><b style="color:#a34500;">For Daily CSP Bookings  :</b> </p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">SBI TT Selling Rate of Date of CSP (D)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  OR</p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">FBIL Reference Rate of Date of CSP (D) + Re.0.10 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  OR</p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">SBI TT Selling Rate of Date next to Date of CSP (D+1)  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  OR</p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">FBIL Reference Rate of Date next to Date of CSP (D+1) + Re. 0.10</p>
        
        
        </br>
        <p><b>Note :</b> Exchange rate of Previous working day in case of SBI/FBIL holiday on date of CSP for CSP (D) option and Next working day in case of SBI/FBIL holiday on date of CSP for CSP (D+1) option.</p>
        
        
        <p style="padding-left:40px;"><b style="color:#a34500;">For Average CSP Bookings :</b> </p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">Average SBI TT Selling Rate of W/FN/M   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  OR</p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">Average FBIL Reference Rate of W/FN/M + Re.0.10</p>
        
        </br>
        <p>The customer shall select one particular Exchange Rate Option out of the above, at the time of submitting their booking in HCL website.</p>
        
        </br>
        <p><b style="color:#a34500;">e)&nbsp;<u>Handling Charges</u> :</b> Rs. 3300 PMT</p>
        
        </br>
        <p><b style="color:#a34500;">f)&nbsp;<u> Price Differential</u> :</b></p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">CC Rod 8mm Non Standard – Rs.400/-PMT lower than CC Rod 8mm</p>
        <p style="padding-left:40px;">Cathode (Cut)-Ex-ICC  – Rs.1500/-PMT higher than Cathode (Full)</p>
        
        
        
        
        </br>
        <p><b>Note :</b> GST and such other taxes as may be applicable shall be charged to customers as per rules.</p>


        
        
    </div>
